(ORGANIC EGYPTIAN AGRICULTURE & BIO-FERTILITY MANUAL \(2026 CERTIFIED EDITION\)) Tj
T* (Strict Policy: 100% Organic Inputs Only - Zero Synthetic Fertilizers or Chemical Pesticides) Tj
T* (1. Thermal Aerobic Compost & Vermicompost Standards \(per Feddan = 4200 m2\):) Tj
T* (- Mature Plant-Animal Compost: 15 to 25 m3/feddan; C:N ratio 15:1 to 20:1; thermophilic phase 55-65C for 15 days) Tj
T* (  to eliminate weed seeds, root-knot nematodes, and E. coli/Salmonella pathogens.) Tj
T* (- Vermicompost \(Earthworm Castings\): 1.5 to 3.0 tonnes/feddan banded in planting rows; supplies humic/fulvic acids,) Tj
T* (  plant-available organic N, beneficial actinomycetes, and natural root growth enzymes.) Tj
T* (- Aerated Compost Tea \(ACT\): Brew 10 kg vermicompost + 1.5 L sugarcane molasses + 250 g kelp extract in 200 L) Tj
T* (  dechlorinated water with continuous air-pump oxygenation for 24-36 hours; inject 40-60 L/feddan via drip.) Tj
