(2. Natural Mineral & Bio-Fertilizer Replacements \(Zero Chemical NPK\):) Tj
T* (- Organic Nitrogen: Legume green manures \(Egyptian Berseem clover incorporate 35-45 kg organic N/feddan\),) Tj
T* (  Rhizobium inoculant \(Okadin\) on legumes, free-living Azotobacter chroococcum & Azospirillum brasilense \(2 L/feddan\),) Tj
T* (  and enzymatic plant amino acids or hydrolyzed fish emulsion.) Tj
T* (- Organic Phosphorus: Natural ground Rock Phosphate \(300-400 kg/feddan, 26-30% P2O5 natural mineral\) activated with) Tj
T* (  Bacillus megaterium \(Phosphorine bio-inoculant, 2 L/feddan\) + Mycorrhizal fungi + 100 kg micronized elemental sulfur.) Tj
T* (- Organic Potassium: Natural ground Potassium Feldspar \(250-500 kg/feddan\) solubilized by Bacillus mucilaginosus) Tj
T* (  + Ascophyllum nodosum marine kelp extract sprays during flowering, fruit set, and tuber/bulb bulking.) Tj
T* (3. Biological Pest & Disease Control & Organic Certification \(Egypt Law 12/2020 & EU Organic\):) Tj
T* (- Lepidoptera \(Fall Armyworm, Tuta absoluta\): Trichogramma cards \(25-30/feddan\) + Bacillus thuringiensis \(Bt\)) Tj
